{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42399","headline":"送陈秘监归泉州 · 徐铉","name":"送陈秘监归泉州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风满潮沟木叶飞，水边行客驻骖騑。\n三朝恩泽冯唐老，万里乡关贺监归。\n世路穷通前事远，半生谈笑此心违。\n离歌不识高堂庆，特地令人泪满衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}